# Google OAuth. Copy to .env and fill in. Leave empty to disable sign-in —
# quotes, charts and the style screens work without an account.
#
# Create them in https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials (free):
#   1. Create a project (or reuse one) and enable the "Google People API" if asked.
#   2. OAuth consent screen: External, add your Google account as a test user.
#   3. Credentials → Create credentials → OAuth client ID:
#        - Web application  → paste into EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID
#          Authorised redirect URI:
#            Expo Go:   exp://127.0.0.1:8081/--/auth
#            Dev build: paperterminalapp://auth
#        - iOS / Android  → paste into the matching variable below.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID=
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ANDROID_CLIENT_ID=
